\section{The \ridge\label{resultsridge}}
The \ridge is an unexpected phenomenon first observed in \Au collisions.  In order to understand its origins and to provide a robust test of models for the production of the \ridge, the \ridge is studied as a function of as many variables as possible.  The collision energy, collision system, system size, and trigger particle type dependence of the \ridge are presented here.

